A||||10||Rodney||Thank you note||||1||
Z||000000||Rodney||10-05-2001||11:37 AM||||To all Fiero Enthusiasts,<P>I would like to thank all of you for the exceptional<BR>support this past week.<BR>The amount of support was a tremendous surprise. You<BR>all are true enthusiasts<BR>by not only showing support for the cars but also the<BR>specialized vendors who<BR>assist in keeping your cars running and looking good.<BR>Everyone makes mistakes<BR>and we all learn from them. Now, let's put all this<BR>controversy behind us and<BR>move on! I am looking forward to continuing to offer<BR>innovative high quality Fiero products to all. <P>Thank You,<BR>Rodney Dickman<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||10-05-2001||11:52 AM||||And a thanks in response to you Rodney.  For keeping the Fiero alive (my headlights specifically  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">).  And producing strange parts that no one initally thinks of, but everyone needs along the way. I believe that without you, there might be fewer Fieros still on the road today.<P>Thanks!<P><P>------------------<BR>           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||California Kid||10-05-2001||04:13 PM||||Happy things are working out Rodney. Looking forward to even more creative things you come up with.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_7.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||fierobaby||10-05-2001||04:20 PM||||Rodney,<P>Well I think you deserve a thank you also... Thank you for handelig all of this with grace and maturity... most people would get very mad and begin cusing out people but you just asked for help and were polite about getting what you wanted... also thank you for making the thigns you do!!!<P>Corinne<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="LETTER"> AIM: Fierobaby87<BR>http://angelfire.com/sports/sfiero </FONT><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
