Z||000005||Fiero5||10-05-2001||09:35 PM||||I think that it was one of the best case scenarios that we could have ever hoped for.<BR>I know that without Rodney's great stuff, the Kelley Family Fieros wouldn't be as enjoyable to own, drive and show off as they are with all his goodies  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Thanks Rodney for being there and doing all you do for the Fiero community.<P>The Kelley's||||reg||6
