Z||000007||JSocha||10-06-2001||01:52 AM||||If it wasn't for you assisting me today in an attempt to get your tool out for the dew strips today per my desperate request, I'm sure I would be lost.  You are someone willing to go the extra step to help us Fiero Enthusiasts!  I hope in the future, under less pressure, I can order something that is not a rush!  Of course I'll check to find what I need first here on PFF before tearing into things so I have them ordered first.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>We need people like you who do what you do to help all of us out in the best way through creativity, innovation and dedication!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Sincerely yours...<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000008||artherd||10-06-2001||04:00 AM||||Hi Rodney, your contributions to our community make owning a Fiero even more of a rewarding expierence!!<P>We'd be lost (or at least stuck with crappy shifters and weak decklids and epeleptic headlights) withought you.<P>Thank you so much for everything you do, I hope to be buying more and more awesome parts, etc. from you years and years down the road.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000009||86seyellow||10-06-2001||07:13 AM||||Rodney,,<P>All I can say is thanks for not giving in. I have been doing everythin to my car. I now run into fixing the items you have. All I can say is you will be gettign a large order form me soon. ALl I have heard is nothing but great service, great products and great guy.<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/86seyellow_new1.JPG">    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieropix1_copy1.jpg"> <BR>I can go as fast as I want unless I get caught||||reg||1
